    (MS (mkR ra sp gp tp t0 t1 t2 s0 s1 (Z_to_bv 64 addr) (Z_to_bv 64 size) (Z_to_bv 64 v) a3 a4 a5 a6 a7 s2 s3 s4 s5 s6 s7 s8 s9 s10 s11 t3 t4 t5 t6)
        F (Z_to_bv 64 poison_entry) fc None m (seg_rom asegs)).
